        "filing_date": "2025-08-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As of June 27, 2025, we had 579 employees, including hardware and software architects and design engineers, primarily engaged in engineering, research, and product development activities.",
        "start_character": 41567,
        "end_character": 41754
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001049521-25-000024",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001049521-25-000024-d1171d3917644c82",
        "accession_number": "0001049521-25-000024",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For Mercury, this means ensuring our products and solutions have not been and cannot be tampered with, and that what we deliver to our customers is not compromised at any point during the development lifecycle, from procurement to manufacturing.",
        "start_character": 18800,
        "end_character": 19045
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001049521-25-000024",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001049521-25-000024-d1171d3917644c82",
        "accession_number": "0001049521-25-000024",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In our product businesses, we invest in internal R&D to develop new capabilities that can be leveraged by multiple customers and support a wide variety of mission areas and applications.",
        "start_character": 4437,
        "end_character": 4623
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001049521-25-000024",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001049521-25-000024-d1171d3917644c82",
        "accession_number": "0001049521-25-000024",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In our solutions business, we engage with customers to develop capabilities that meet exacting mission requirements and retire risk in a development phase before entering a production phase that can last many years and include numerous technological evolutions.",
        "start_character": 4624,
        "end_character": 4885
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001049521-25-000024",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001049521-25-000024-d1171d3917644c82",
        "accession_number": "0001049521-25-000024",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have a comprehensive quality and process control plan for each of our products, which include a supply chain management program and the use of automated inspection and test equipment to assure the quality and reliability of our products.",
        "start_character": 44467,
        "end_character": 44707
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001049521-25-000024",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001049521-25-000024-d1171d3917644c82",
        "accession_number": "0001049521-25-000024",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We operate in a highly competitive marketplace characterized by rapidly changing technology, frequent product performance improvements, increasing speed of deployment to align with warfighters’ needs and evolving industry standards and requirements coming from our customers or the DoD.",
        "start_character": 38948,
        "end_character": 39234
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001049521-25-000024",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001049521-25-000024-d1171d3917644c82",
        "accession_number": "0001049521-25-000024",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Because of the broad demand for high-performance processing at the edge across defense missions, we operate in a number of the larger, faster growing parts of the market, from C4I to sensor processing, and spanning all operational domains—air, land, sea, space, and cyber.",
        "start_character": 21298,
        "end_character": 21570
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001049521-25-000024",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001049521-25-000024-d1171d3917644c82",
        "accession_number": "0001049521-25-000024",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "During fiscal 2025, we have also invested $1.7 million in formal leadership programs to further develop our leaders, at various levels: leadership cohorts, mentor programs;",
        "start_character": 53927,
        "end_character": 54099
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001049521-25-000024",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001049521-25-000024-d1171d3917644c82",
        "accession_number": "0001049521-25-000024",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition, we believe our size, scale and stability in addition to the investments we have made in our domestic manufacturing capabilities and infrastructure, make us a more reliable and attractive outsourcing partner for our customers relative to smaller sub-scale providers.",
